SUMMARY:The Art of Brown County - Scenes & Views
DESCRIPTION:Special Exhibition & Sale\nThe Art of Brown County – Scenes & Views is a special exhibition and sale that celebrates the familiar vistas\, treasured locations\, and fresh perspectives that honor both the natural beauty and rich artistic heritage of the area. \nFind the places you love reflected in original works by the artists of the Brown County Art Guild. Every painting tells a story of Brown County& Nashville\, Indiana with color\, light and texture.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/the-art-of-brown-county-scenes-views/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/art_of_BC_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
