SUMMARY:Winter Wishes pARTy
DESCRIPTION:Winter Wishes pARTy\nA Studio Sale of Art & Artisan Wares\nSaturday\, November 21\, 2026\n1-4pm \nThe Art Guild has a long tradition of supporting Indiana’s vibrant art scene. What better way to celebrate than by showcasing the work of the Guild artists\, new exhibitions and Guild artisans at a special event just in time for the holidays. \nCome and explore dozens of beautiful\, handcrafted treasures throughout the gallery—perfect for gifting or collecting! \n3pm:  Raffle drawing for Allen Hutton painting
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/winter-wishes-party/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/winter_wishes_web_event.jpg
